# Build context hygiene (#6657). Dockerfile is `COPY . .`, so platform_v2/.env
# (9.7 KB of secrets), the session vault and service-account credentials were
# baked into every archie_platform/archie_scheduler image. At runtime the tree is
# bind-mounted over /app, so nothing here changes behaviour — it only keeps
# secrets and 37 MB of tests out of the image layers.
.env
.env.*
secrets/
credentials/
tests/
logs/
screenshots/
_deprecated/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.git/
